{"id":"89857797f370531c","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/615_Lewis_反事实逻辑_VCU.md","title":"615 Lewis 反事实逻辑 VCU","display":"615_Lewis_反事实逻辑_VCU","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-符号表\">1. 符号表</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\">\\(\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}\\)</span>。原始公式构造子为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}\\)</span>，其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>派生记号：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本系统没有绑定构造子。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式\">2. 公式</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变元、替换、结构等价\">3. 自由变元、替换、结构等价</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{615}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}_{615}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(\\bot)=\\varnothing,\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(\\neg A)=\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{615}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义有限支撑替换集合</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{615}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Subst}_{615}=\n\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}:\n\\{p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}:\\sigma(p)\\ne\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\}\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{Prop})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{615}\">\\(\\sigma\\in\\mathsf{Subst}_{615}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{615}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{615}(\\sigma,A)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\)</span>，其中扩张满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\bot)=\\bot,\\quad\n\\widehat\\sigma(\\neg A)=\\neg\\widehat\\sigma(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\widehat\\sigma(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\square\\!\\!\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\widehat\\sigma(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)=\\widehat\\sigma(A)\\square\\!\\!\\to\\widehat\\sigma(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{615}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BV}_{615}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\to\\{\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BV}_{615}(A)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{BV}_{615}(A)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_{\\alpha,615}B\">\\(A\\equiv_{\\alpha,615}B\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\">\\(A=B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-公理集合\">4. 公理集合</h1>\n<p>命题公理：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{615}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{615}=\\{A\\to(B\\to A):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{615}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{615}=\\{(A\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\to B)\\to(A\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{615}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{615}=\\{((\\neg A\\to\\neg B)\\to(B\\to A)):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Lewis <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 核心：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{615}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{615}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\to C))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{615}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\lor(A\\square\\!\\!\\to\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{615}\n=\n\\{(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\lor(A\\square\\!\\!\\to\\neg B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{615}\n=\n\\{((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\land(B\\square\\!\\!\\to A))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{615}\n=\n\\{((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\land(B\\square\\!\\!\\to A))\\to((A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>VCU 的中心与后件合取族：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{VC}^{615}\n=\n\\{(A\\land B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{VC}^{615}\n=\n\\{(A\\land B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{U}^{615}\n=\n\\{((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\land(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C))\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\land C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{U}^{615}\n=\n\\{((A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\land(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C))\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to(B\\land C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>总公理集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{615}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{615}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{615}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{VC}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{U}^{615}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{615}\n=\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,1}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,2}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\to,3}^{615}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V K}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CEM}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{V CSO}^{615}\n\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{VC}^{615}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{U}^{615}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-推理规则关系\">5. 推理规则关系</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{615}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{MP}^{615}=\\{((A,A\\to B),B):A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{615}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCF}^{615}\n=\n\\{((B\\to C),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{615}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{RCEA}^{615}\n=\n\\{((A\\leftrightarrow B),(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)):A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{615}\">\\(\\mathsf{Rule}_{615}\\)</span> 为三者的并。</p>\n<h1 id=\"6.-证明对象\">6. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Proof}_{615}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathsf{Proof}_{615}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 为所有非空有限依赖序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\">\\(((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\Delta_i\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>。每行至少满足下列 5 个条件之一：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\{A_i\\}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{615}\">\\(A_i\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{615}\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_k=A_j\\to A_i\">\\(A_k=A_j\\to A_i\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\">\\(\\Delta_i=\\Delta_j\\cup\\Delta_k\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=B\\to C\">\\(A_j=B\\to C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to B)\\to(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\">\\(A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\">\\(A_j=A\\leftrightarrow B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\">\\(A_i=(A\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\leftrightarrow(B\\square\\!\\!\\to C)\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\">\\(\\Delta_j=\\Delta_i=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可证性\">7. 可证性</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_{615}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_{615}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{615}(\\Gamma)\">\\(\\pi=((\\Delta_i,A_i))_{i&lt;m}\\in\\mathsf{Proof}_{615}(\\Gamma)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;m\">\\(i&lt;m\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i=A\">\\(A_i=A\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\">\\(\\Delta_i\\subseteq\\Gamma\\)</span>。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Thm}_{615}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{615}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Thm}_{615}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}:\\varnothing\\vdash_{615}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-相似选择语义\">8. 相似选择语义</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"615\">\\(615\\)</span>-Lewis VCU 模型类 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{615}^{CU}\">\\(\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{615}^{CU}\\)</span>。其元素为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sel}:W\\times\\mathcal P(W)\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>。下列选择约束均对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\subseteq W\">\\(X,Y\\subseteq W\\)</span> 成立：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\ne\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\ne\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)|\\le1,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)|\\le1,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"w\\in X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)=\\{w\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[w\\in X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)=\\{w\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>以及系统性条件</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y)\\subseteq X\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)=\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)\\subseteq Y\\land\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y)\\subseteq X\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{Sel}(w,X)=\\operatorname{Sel}(w,Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公式真值集</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦-⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦-⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由下列子句递归定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\operatorname{atom}(p)⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}=V(p),\n\\qquad\n⟦\\bot⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\neg A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\neg A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\n=W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\to B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\to B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\n=(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ A\\square\\!\\!\\to B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ A\\square\\!\\!\\to B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\n=\n\\{w\\in W:\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M})\\subseteq⟦ B⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>满足与语义后承为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{615}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{615}A\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\models_{615}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{615}^{CU}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{615}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{615}A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\models_{615}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathcal M=(W,V,\\operatorname{Sel})\\in\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{615}^{CU}\\ \\forall w\\in W\n\\bigl((\\forall G\\in\\Gamma\\ \\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{615}G)\\Rightarrow\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_{615}A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-目标区分\">9. 目标区分</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"615\">\\(615\\)</span> 的公理清单在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 核上列出中心性 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{VC}^{615}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{VC}^{615}\\)</span> 与后件合取族 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{U}^{615}\">\\(\\mathsf{Ax}_{U}^{615}\\)</span>。U 把同一前件下的两个后件合成为合取后件；这里与第 613、614 条的比较只指公理清单呈现，不断言 U 带来严格后承增量或额外的模型唯一性。</p>\n<h1 id=\"10.-结构说明\">10. 结构说明</h1>\n<p>第 8 节的选择子集、非空、至多单点、中心性和系统性条件与第 613 条所列选择约束相同；非空条件集的唯一选择点来自非空性与至多单点约束。U 在此仅作为额外列出的后件合取公理族。其语义形状由集合恒等事实给出：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq Y\\land S\\subseteq Z\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad S\\subseteq Y\\cap Z.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S\\subseteq Y\\land S\\subseteq Z\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad S\\subseteq Y\\cap Z.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M})\">\\(S=\\operatorname{Sel}(w,⟦ A⟧_{615}^{\\mathcal M})\\)</span> 即得 U 的真值条件；这项事实本身不要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 至多单点。本条目不以此陈述 U 在所列句法演算中的可推导性或冗余定理。</p>\n<h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{LewisVCU}_{615}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{615},\\operatorname{FV}_{615},\\operatorname{BV}_{615},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{615},\\operatorname{Sub}_{615},\\equiv_{\\alpha,615},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{615},\\mathsf{Rule}_{615},\\mathsf{Proof}_{615},\\vdash_{615},\\mathsf{Thm}_{615},\n\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{615}^{CU},⟦-⟧_{615},\\Vdash_{615},\\models_{615}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{LewisVCU}_{615}\n=\n(\\mathsf{Prop},\\mathsf{Frm}_{615},\\operatorname{FV}_{615},\\operatorname{BV}_{615},\n\\mathsf{Subst}_{615},\\operatorname{Sub}_{615},\\equiv_{\\alpha,615},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{615},\\mathsf{Rule}_{615},\\mathsf{Proof}_{615},\\vdash_{615},\\mathsf{Thm}_{615},\n\\mathsf{LewisMod}_{615}^{CU},⟦-⟧_{615},\\Vdash_{615},\\models_{615}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统含反事实句法、公理、规则、证明关系、中心合取选择语义与语义后承；不在本条目中断言可靠性、完备性或其他元定理。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-符号表","text":"1. 符号表","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式","text":"2. 公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变元、替换、结构等价","text":"3. 自由变元、替换、结构等价","level":1},{"id":"4.-公理集合","text":"4. 公理集合","level":1},{"id":"5.-推理规则关系","text":"5. 推理规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明对象","text":"6. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"7.-可证性","text":"7. 可证性","level":1},{"id":"8.-相似选择语义","text":"8. 相似选择语义","level":1},{"id":"9.-目标区分","text":"9. 目标区分","level":1},{"id":"10.-结构说明","text":"10. 结构说明","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(X)=\\{Y:Y\\subseteq X\\text{ 且 }Y\\text{ 有限}\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom},\\bot,\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp},\\operatorname{cf}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\square\\!\\!\\to B=\\operatorname{cf}(A,B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\top=(\\bot\\to\\bot),\\quad\nA\\land B=\\neg(A\\to\\neg B),\\quad\nA\\lor B=(\\neg A\\to B),\\quad\nA\\leftrightarrow B=(A\\to B)\\land(B\\to A).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{615}","display":f